  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tomorrow is a new day: Towards Social Justice, Peace, and Hope in Eswatini</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is a bridging fund post end of SWA053 project. This is meant to support continued operation of the Diocese of Manzini&apos;s Justice and Peace Commission as well as sustaining the gains from the just ended project. Specific focus is on:
Outcome 1: Strengthened women and youth agency in peacebuilding and promotion of social cohesion.
Outcome 2: Strengthened capacity of churches to lead and influence the dialogue process from national to sub-national level. This include supporting the functioning of the newly established Catholic Parliamentary Liaison Office in Eswatini
Outcome 3: Enhanced provision of psycho-social support (PSS) to victims of injustices.</narrative>
  </description>
